 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? At night I talk to someone who isn't there anymore.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You walk to the trap line with Dwayne. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"There's more, but that's for another fire.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Dwayne grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "🤝 Dwayne is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"What's something you're good at that nobody here knows about?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Noted. Filing that under 'extremely useful.' The village needs that. Not that it matters.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Still on what you're good at.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Not right now. I've got my own things to handle.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You walk to the trap line with Rewi. Nothing much there — but they talk the whole way, and you learn the shape of them a little better."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Since Felicia died... I keep expecting to see Felicia at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Felicia said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 45,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Can we talk? Have you seen anyone on the roads? Anyone at all? I'm asking everyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "They nod. \"Okay.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Do you believe in anything? Now, I mean. After everything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Sure — That's not naive. That's load-bearing. Hold onto it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Listen to me — Still on what you believe in.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"I'd love to. Lead the way.\" (They're already checking your pack.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Go. But sit with what I said.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Mayapple — I keep thinking about what you said. I'm seeing it everywhere now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "At the trap line the ground is torn up. Something was here, recently, and it wasn't careful. Dwayne's hand finds your sleeve. You leave together, faster than you came."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "You show them Chinese Chestnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 49,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Pantry's thin and getting thinner. Come forage with me tomorrow — two of us can fill packs.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"I did the count twice. The count doesn't change. Nobody's worked the old burn east of camp in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"Pattern Hunger. They just... took Rewi. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Same weather, different day. I keep notes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"We'll see what the treeline brings. We always do.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "🤝 Dwayne is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"You said you believe we get through this — the alternative doesn't work. Still holding the line?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Walk with me? I want another pair of eyes on something.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "It's quiet at the tree line. Miguel doesn't say much. Sometimes that's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Still on that personal stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"We're eating through stores faster than we replace them. Forage with me tomorrow? I know the south slope below the meadow.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"The stores won't stretch past tomorrow, and I'm not choosing who eats. Nobody's worked the south slope below the meadow in days. We'll fill packs before dark.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"That's enough for now. It'll percolate.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 56,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"What's something from your old life that's actually useful here?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Not dumb at all. The people who can't wait are the ones who make mistakes. You're an asset.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Still on your useful old-life skills.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"I work alone. Nothing personal. ...It's a little personal.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"I dreamed Trong was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "You show them Mayapple — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Trong said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"I wish we had longer. Soon, yeah?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 67,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "It's not about power. It's about making sure someone's thinking three steps ahead."
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "At the ridge the ground is torn up. Something was here, recently, and it wasn't careful. Priya's hand finds your sleeve. You leave together, faster than you came."
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"This one — Asian Persimmon. Leaf, stem, smell. You won't forget it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"a burned farmhouse — I'll show you on the map sometime. It's real.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"If I don't step up, someone worse will. That's not ambition, that's arithmetic.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"It's not about power. It's about — someone has to decide, and I'd rather it be someone who'll lose sleep over it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Still on wanting to be in charge.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Okay. Yeah. I trust you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "Dwayne nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"I can't reach this properly. Could you take a look?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"It keeps getting worse. I can't haul or hunt with it like this — and if it festers, I'm done for. Please, clean it out and bind it tight.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"The Pit. They just... took Dwayne. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"I wake before anyone else. It passes the time. The time passes anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "Priya nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"...Sorry, lost my train of thought.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 73,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They spread their hands, smiling — the words are missing, but the meaning lands anyway."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod back, a little quicker this time."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. A smile, tired but real."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They answer at length. You point at yourself, then at them, then at the fire. Together. They get it."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "You listen hard, watching their mouth shape the words. Sounds, and the shape of meaning just out of reach."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Hm. Almost.\" Dieu corrects the one word, gently, like setting a bone. \"Again.\" You say it right. They nod, satisfied with both of you."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Anyway — I should get going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"What do you make of all this? Really. There. Said it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Look. Bleak. Probably true. I keep looking for the part where it's not.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Hm. Still on what you make of all this.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Yes. Absolutely. I've been hoping you'd ask.\" (A little too quickly.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Right. Done. Don't look so relieved.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 87,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"About the food I needed — I hate to ask twice, but it's still open. Will you?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"It's been too long since a real meal. I'm slowing down — stupid, clumsy. Help me get back on my feet.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"All right — let's ask them.\" You carry the proposal to The Red Table."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back."
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"Why are you interrogating me?\" Albertine's voice goes cold. \"We're all lying about something out here. You want to go first?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 95,
   "text": "They nod, already turning away."
  }
 ],
