 "funeral": {
  "scriptedBurial": {
   "found": true,
   "respectsOk": true,
   "buryOk": true,
   "buried": true
  },
  "deathBeat": [
   "d42: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. Felicia Diaz is dead. You didn't ask. It knew.",
   "d42: 🕯️ Felicia Diaz is dead — the expedition. The village stops. Somebody screams. Somebody else starts digging.",
   "d42: The village's quarrel was with Felicia — and Felicia is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d42: 📖 The Codex turns a page on its own. The Callback is dead. You didn't ask. It knew."
  ],
  "recoverHome": [
   "d43: That night, they bring Felicia home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours."
  ],
  "vouch": [
   "d42: At the grave, Dwayne, Rewi, Somchai and 4 more speak for Trong — \"Felicia trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."
  ],
  "systemVoice": [
   "d42: 📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Miguel just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
  ],
  "burialWindowSay": [
   "d42: The village's quarrel was with Felicia — and Felicia is dead. The sentence doesn't cross the grave. You're someone else now; the docket is empty, but the village remembers.",
   "d42: At the grave, Dwayne, Rewi, Somchai and 4 more speak for Trong — \"Felicia trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens.",
   "d43: That night, they bring Felicia home. Nobody asks you to help carry; nobody has to. By morning the grave is dug by the fire, and the body is laid out beside it. The filling of it is yours.",
   "d43: ◈ The System files the name away with visible satisfaction. It has so few words for things that bleed. (+2 integration)",
